/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":2562390,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2562390","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:32:36Z","value":43,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5126500","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2562390-1846651706691291","game_id":"steam-2562390","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is Live!","summary":"Hello there brave recruits! Steam Next Fest begins today!This marks the perfect time for you to play our gameplay demo for Benny’s Backrooms, available for download now!You can also join our official Discord server to chat about the game and find fellow backrooms dwellers to play with!Wishlist Benny’s Backrooms today on Steam!Our game releases in Early Access on October 27.It will be priced at $9.99 USD / $12.99 CAD / $14.50 AUD / €9.75 EUR / £8.50 GBP. And for the first two weeks after launch, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691291","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2562390-1846018067941924","game_id":"steam-2562390","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Demo Available Now!","summary":"This is not a drill! The time has come… Benny is finally ready to welcome you into the Backrooms with our brand new FREE gameplay demo!In this demo, you will play through the entire first level of our game with up to 4 players! Grab your friends, prepare your equipment, and try your best not to become wall decor. Benny’s own friends will be eagerly awaiting your arrival within the depths…UNLOCK 2 EXCLUSIVE REWARDS upon completing the demo!Test Dummy Hazmat Suit\"Glee & Whimsy\" MaskWISHLIST THE FU","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T18:06:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941924","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2562390-1845383656394463","game_id":"steam-2562390","kind":"announcement","title":"Benny's Backrooms is releasing October 27!","summary":"You heard that right! We're pleased to announce that Benny's Backrooms is releasing in Early Access on October 27, 2026! The date is locked in, Benny is getting restless, and we’re finally getting very close to opening the Backrooms for everyone. But you won’t have to wait quite that long to jump in...Try the game early on October 12!Can't wait until the 27th? No worries! Jump into the Backrooms early on October 12 when the free demo goes live! Grab some friends, enter the Backrooms, and try you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T19:25:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394463","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2562390-1835236783560289","game_id":"steam-2562390","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for Playing the Benny’s Backrooms Public Playtest!","summary":"Our First Public Playtest has ended...Benny has returned to the Backrooms alone… for now.Missing Benny already? Wishlist for Updates!Huge thanks to everyone who jumped in, played, got lost, escaped, screamed, broke things, reported bugs, shared feedback, or watched their friends get hunted down by Benny while making the wise tactical decision to run in the opposite direction.This playtest was a big milestone for us. Over the past several months, we’ve been rebuilding Benny’s Backrooms into a big","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T13:00:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783560289","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2562390-1833968530886035","game_id":"steam-2562390","kind":"announcement","title":"Benny’s Backrooms Playtest is Now Live!","summary":"After months of hard work rebuilding this game from the ground up, we’re excited to open the doors to Benny’s Backrooms for our first public playtest! Players are beginning to enter the new version of Benny’s Backrooms, and we’re excited to start seeing how everyone survives the chaos.This event will run from May 27th to June 10th.If you haven’t signed up yet, there’s still time! Head over to the Steam page and request Playtest access during the event.Don’t get left behind like Benny bait...A fe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-27T17:01:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530886035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2562390-1832700592799227","game_id":"steam-2562390","kind":"announcement","title":"We're still here, and a playtest is coming your way!","summary":"Hello everyone!It's been a long time with no news from us, and if you're on our Discord server, you've probably already heard that we're alive and well. Benny's Backrooms is still happening and being worked on! ːsteamhappyːTurns out game development is way harder than it looks like on Youtube (like suspiciously hard), and just to be sure we checked if the devs are still alive (they are, well, uh, most of them at least!)The team has been hard at work rebuilding the game from the ground up!We’re s","occurred_at"